<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Gaelic games-All-Ireland championship results.</title>
<headline>Gaelic games-All-Ireland championship results.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of All-Ireland senior championship games played over the weekend.</p>
<p>Munster hurling, first round in Ennis</p>
<p>    Clare	    3-24  Kerry	   1-06</p>
<p>Munster football, preliminary round replay in Clonmel</p>
<p>    Tipperary	1-17  Limerick	2-08</p>
<p>Leinster hurling, preliminary round in Mullingar</p>
<p>    Offaly	   3-20  Meath	   0-08</p>
<p>    Dublin	   5-15  Westmeath     2-08</p>
<p>Leinster football, preliminary round replay in Mullingar</p>
<p>    Westmeath	2-17  Wexford	 1-15</p>
<p>Ulster football, preliminary round</p>
<p>    Tyrone	   0-15  Down	    2-09</p>
<p>Replay in Down next Sunday, venue to be announced</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377</p>
</text>
